    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', fontSize: 24, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>行业常规：30—50 人团队 · 数千万投入 · 2—3 年</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif', fontSize: 24, color: '#22D3EE', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>→ 1 个人 · 14 个月干完</Text>
